    "description": "7.62x39 Ammo Storage Boxes: FFFTech/FFFTechnology\n\nBoxes for storing 7.62x39 cartridges. Often the ammunition is packed in 20rd cheap cardboard, and when filling a \nstandard 30rd AK magazine, the 2nd box is left with 10rds. Better to store them in a dedicated casing, rather than \nleft in the easily ripped cardboard boxes. \n\nOr if you're an absolute nutter and... reload ammo for the AK platform (A sign of insanity) these storage boxes are \nof good use. \n\nTwo variants are available:\n\n *10rd\n *20rd\n\n\nPrinter Used: Ender 3 V2\n\nFilament Used: PLA+\n\nPrint Settings:\n\nExtruder: 218C \nBed: 56C \nFirst Layer Print Height: .2mm \nStandard Layer Height: .16mm+\nWall Thickness: .40 \nWall Perimeters: 3+\nInfill: 20%\nInfill Pattern: Gyroid\nMaterial Flow: 100%\nSupport Material Percentage: 20%",
